    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28159" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mastĭchē</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mastĭcē</span></b> ),
			ēs, f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαστίχη</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>mastic, an odoriferous gum from the
			mastic-tree</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 12, 17, 36, § 72</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">21, 16, 56, §
				96</span></i>; <i><span class="en">14, 20, 25,
				§ 122</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Capitol. Gord.
			19</span></i>.— Post-class. collat. forms: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mastĭcha</span></b> , ae,
