				Oct. 14, 3</span></i> (al. mastichae), and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mastix</span></b> , mastĭchis,
				abl. mastichĕ, <i><span class="en">Ser.
				Samm. 156</span></i>; <i><span class="en">447</span></i>;
		<i><span class="en">423</span></i>.</div>
